Results/Analysis contains the newest result of every scenario. All files of one result have the same
"<scenario>_<timestamp>" in their name.

Written by the Julia model (Models/Main_base.jl, Models/Main_GGV.jl):
- CompAssignments: ordered composition of every trip
- Inventory: start and end inventory per station and unit type (needed by the unit assignment and the station diagram)
- GGVLinks: used GGV links with the block of units and the sides of both trains (GGV only)
- StoredTrains: trains that stay on the track and continue as a later train (only if stored trains are on)
- UnitFlows: source and destination of every unit position (input of the unit assignment)
- Summary: settings, lexicographic stages and key figures

Written by the unit assignment (Models/Main_assignUnits.py):
- UnitAssignment: unit on every position of every trip
- UnitTimeline: day plan of every unit
- UnitSummary: checks against the model, units and costs

Results/Archive contains older results and the results of the old models (SimpleModel, UnitPreservation).
To use an archived result again (unit assignment, diagrams), move its files back to Results/Analysis.
